            "stencilId": "cloud-output"
          },
          "label": "About the options",
          "value": "<p>The first option applies to this rerun only. The other two are saved on the search and apply to the nightly sync and to later reruns; every rerun shows them again, so you can change them at any time.</p><p>Each file asset's <b>DataXray Sync</b> attribute says whether it is <i>Kept in sync nightly</i> or a <i>One-time import</i>. A file stays in sync while at least one search that returns it is kept in sync nightly, so unticking <b>Keep in sync nightly</b> here only affects files no other synced search returns.</p>",
          "defaultValue": false,
          "size": 12,
          "ignore": false,
          "visible": true,
          "enabled": true,
          "isRequired": false,
          "id": "optionsNote",
          "type": "htmlComponent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cols": [
        {
          "designInfo": {
            "stencilSuperIds": [
              "Output"
            ],
            "stencilId": "cloud-output"
          },
          "label": "Finish",
          "value": "<p>Click <b>Send</b> to run the rerun. It works in the background; a <b>Rerun Summary</b> task will appear in your inbox when it finishes.</p>",
